[05:08] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'for LM Studio, Ollama, and llama.cpp, so you don\'t need the full BF16 weights. A 4-bit quant fits comfortably on a Mac with 32 gigs of unified memory. It\'s pretty simple and easy to install. When serving, I\'d recommend you to keep'

[05:21] [scene:talk]
